cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "EquiFiLM: Charge-Conditioned Equivariant Force Fields via Feature-wise Linear Modulation"
message: "Anonymous submission to NeurIPS 2026 AI for Science track. After acceptance the citation will be updated with author names and DOI."
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: "Anonymous"
    family-names: "Submission"
abstract: >
  Reference implementation of EquiFiLM, a per-layer Feature-wise Linear
  Modulation adapter for equivariant foundation machine-learning force fields.
  The adapter modulates only scalar channels of each interaction layer's
  message tensor, preserving E(3) equivariance exactly while learning
  charge-aware corrections.
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - machine learning force field
  - equivariant neural network
  - FiLM
  - molecular dynamics
  - charged water
